{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_title", "source_sha256": "05c63cd8352b95228fba25d7aabf71f20b1aa7eb692318fb6314e3e2f1083807", "ja": "ステージに立つということ", "zh": "站在舞台上的意义", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_synopsis", "source_sha256": "35b042b183da7c7f84e9bf06234c8104e4be6983daf643e67e9eeb71edbab953", "ja": "杏奈の新曲公演のレッスンが始まる。だが、\nハイテンションすぎる杏奈に違和感を覚える\nメンバー達。どんなにレッスンをしても不安\nが消えない事を打ち明ける杏奈だったが、\nプロデューサーとの会話で笑顔を取り戻す。", "zh": "杏奈新曲公演的练习开始了。然而，\n成员们却对情绪过于亢奋的杏奈\n感到有些不对劲。杏奈吐露了无论怎样练习\n都无法消除心中不安的烦恼，\n但与制作人的交谈让她重拾了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "c95a6d9c31fbd950bf6e62af0ea150213825e359703b1f1512bc2418af8ce8e1", "ja": "みんな、ありがとー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "484e63806e982f03447e2d303c9b72103b57d2a98e1bffa360aa0c62b6f85bb6", "ja": "杏奈のステージ、もっとみんなに見てほしいから……\nこれからもよろしくねー！", "zh": "因为想让大家多看看杏奈的舞台……以后也请多多关照啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1002_null", "source_sha256": "6af5ed570f88bc2cb8c654f3fb93da819112f536dfb527c614125fe823bc3a1b", "ja": "ワァアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1a6a944db23eaf3e8768867810a038ff8138f4086feefe034b89faddcbc4da18", "ja": "（杏奈の新曲お披露目公演が終わった。\n拍手が続いている……）", "zh": "（杏奈的新歌亮相公演结束了。掌声还在继续……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "47d9bde3d03a81278d1eb36f1c0c9f48ad2a5bd9eff7d45f9f94db32b3fc1c55", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\n杏奈のステージ、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n杏奈的舞台，感觉怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "b9b58eeacc61a0923f5f7a5985ab1b424e6a2352d56388c943e61d9944cc38b3", "ja": "お客さんたちのこと……\n笑顔に、できてた……かな……。", "zh": "客人们……有没有……笑起来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1006_p", "source_sha256": "01d752123bfcb9356b8e0e34dfb2714b15af2ac5916327675e4b160e28b879c0", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。ああ、ちゃんとできてたよ。\nいいステージだった。間違いなく前回を超えたな！", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。嗯，你确实做到了。\n这是场很棒的舞台，毫无疑问超越上一次了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "61f894677028980e218c72594cd8487338b1d5f708e12fae3fa0deef6abcf184", "ja": "本当……？\n杏奈……がんばって、よかった……です……♪", "zh": "真的……？\n杏奈……努力了，真是太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "b871b6c8c9df3803a1fd102163d39c6806644aaa324cf6c9675a5cdd0093abb2", "ja": "ステージに上がる前……すごく、ドキドキしたけど……\n今も……ドキドキ、してます……。", "zh": "上台之前……紧张得不得了，可是……\n现在……也还是很紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6f388d89513209e88b89c38f902c4d9a94f2afbdbc42d37287e98c6045527b51", "ja": "うん。本当に、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "嗯。真的很努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb8e10831411e2188cb2f7ab476e68884338c40dbddeba761a47cd1efb914074", "ja": "杏奈ちゃーーん！\nありさは、ありさはもうっ……感無量ですーー！", "zh": "杏奈——！\n亜利沙、亜利沙真是……感慨万千啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "5247a708d4cc4d6c1e8f658532d4952ab380ee76a02372b50c17e18a6897f8e8", "ja": "ちょっと亜利沙さん、声が大きいよ。\nまだお客さんがいるんだから……。", "zh": "亜利沙姐，声音太大了。\n还有客人在呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b50f9fa3117344c6397c5e2325a9598a9950cddd6e08819138ad2f6f063279d", "ja": "はっ、すみません！\nでもでも、感動が抑えきれず……！", "zh": "啊，抱歉！\n但是但是，我实在抑制不住这份感动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "1fa33fc853570a792960957b349ff3615e5d1e4723ca2a14362a39451f85cf30", "ja": "ふふっ。私もその気持ち、よくわかるわ。\n杏奈ちゃんのステージ、本当にすごかったもの。", "zh": "呵呵，我也很理解那种心情。毕竟杏奈的舞台真的太精彩了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "90b93b12e361d9ce4aa04db2f992ff26eeee1c4c1ddbb17bf4ece82e71f3d6c6", "ja": "はい！\n今日のアンナは、パーフェクトでした！", "zh": "是！\n今天的杏奈，表现得无可挑剔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "479b7f76010c6aca5cbd8ad226bc7d99f8a6b31c00a269ae1d927e0d6a85b0d5", "ja": "まぁ……それは、桃子も思ったけど。\n杏奈さん、本当にお疲れさま。", "zh": "嗯……这个嘛，桃子也是这么想的。\n杏奈姐，真的辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "0d09bd7a27dff2f0f03139d15edb9684dce5995fd5bd953e0a64fd8608bc6bba", "ja": "うん……。みんな、ありがとう……。\n杏奈、がんばってよかった……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢大家……  \n杏奈，努力过真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "4d2dda72b06a7c555da737829c3e132acd9b5a2f095a311e299bda73631a826f", "ja": "それに……みんながいてくれて、よかった……。\nありがとう、ございます……。", "zh": "而且……有大家陪着，真是太好了……\n谢、谢谢大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "ad4a3ff666b28dd61861a77adf98cac99482f615e38918d2c3c53048fe833882", "ja": "そ、そんな！　ありさなんて、必死で\n杏奈ちゃんの横に立ってただけですよぉ！", "zh": "我、我哪有！我只是拼命站在杏奈身边而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "b02fdc94cfec5c7aac0176b01ebc5c1a5cc819efa8f58ce9c0c9260ce1770795", "ja": "それなのに、そんな優しい言葉を……\n杏奈ちゃんはアイドル界の女神ですっ！", "zh": "明明这样，杏奈却对我说出这么温柔的话……\n杏奈是偶像界的女神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "64ff5fb423f2bb69cfe47d0bcdd396e3917f8d0528e799fbf39531d854072363", "ja": "ちょっと……よく、わかんない……。", "zh": "可是……有点……不太明白……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f", "ja": "ええーっ！？", "zh": "咦咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "1a9668e24525ef1320230842446c13c0ee912ba2392e27451f1c6d82270d1697", "ja": "つまり、杏奈ちゃんが大好きってこと。ふふっ♪\n私も今日、一緒のステージに立てて、うれしかったわ。", "zh": "也就是说，我最喜欢杏奈了。呵呵♪\n我今天也能和她一起站上舞台，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "cd8f2036698b81cff6e823b7610401fdff128936516d2ff2a2f189c7ccacbda8", "ja": "ロコもです！　今日のステージはロコの\nイマジネーションを刺激してくれましたからね！", "zh": "ROCO也是！今天的舞台刺激了ROCO的想象力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ae0b29d2c4c2a83d5292f0a3733108121747718164baf968da9248204ae06aa", "ja": "まあ、桃子がいたんだから\nこの結果は当然だと思うけど……。", "zh": "嘛，既然有桃子在，这个结果也是理所当然的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "19aa8f556edc8016ccccff2e60ec7187cf744cfbcde619ca3bf15d2a105eb8ca", "ja": "杏奈さんなら大丈夫って、最初から\nちゃーんとわかってたよ。", "zh": "我从一开始就很清楚，杏奈姐姐肯定没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "bede6889223df6921b88f78604d507de7fdcedb243c5fda0cb18cacbd45989f9", "ja": "そっか……。みんな、ありがとう……\nまた……一緒にライブ、しようね……♪", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢大家……\n下次……再一起开演唱会吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1027_p", "source_sha256": "85d4372e43f861b61168b187f75c5d41a925b150db7a523b0786e528d19b2e89", "ja": "（不安を抱えながらも、最後までやりきる事で、\n杏奈はファンのみんなから最高の笑顔を得た……）", "zh": "（尽管心怀不安，杏奈还是坚持到了最后，收获了来自所有粉丝的最棒笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_062_1028_p", "source_sha256": "71a55754f37f9fb853fc353849fc36167c7335e9027d71f1fc88ab17f1a51b86", "ja": "（それはどんな言葉よりも、自信に繋がるだろう。\n杏奈の次のステージが、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "那一定比任何话语都更能让她建立自信。真期待杏奈的下一场舞台啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
